      "nets": ["SDA", "PWM", "SCK", "POT", "TACH", "RST"],
      "observed": "Both the ATtiny45 U2 and ATtiny13 U3 are connected to the same control and signal nets, including their PB0–PB4 pins and reset pins. For example, U2.6 and U3.6 both connect to PWM, and U2.5 and U3.5 both connect to SDA.",
      "expected": "A fan controller should have one active MCU driving these shared control lines, or explicit isolation/selection circuitry if the two MCU footprints are alternatives. The specification identifies this board as an ATtiny-driven fan controller but does not describe a dual-MCU arrangement.",
